ses and feelings, creating a radical new active wellbeing approach which is shared in her books and sessions in \\'The Reprogramming\\' - a method giving you tools to gaining access to your hidden sub-conscious world, make necessary changes, enabling you to benefit from and enjoy your true inner value and gifts.\", \\'\\\\\\'The Gift of Harmony\\\\\\' is a simple yet powerful concept by Jelila which enables you to understand how 4 characters within you need to work together as a team. It helps you overcome \\\\\\'negative mind talk\\\\\\' and get \\\\\\'all 4 wheels of your car going in the same direction\\\\\\'. The book empowers you - then when you complete the related transformation process - also called The Gift of Harmony - at jelila.com - you can receive their gifts - of love, abundance, joy, and gratitude - elevating you to a whole new level of synergy, ability, success, and happiness in your life. \"The Gift is amazing. Now I have time\" Melanie\\', \"Jelila\\'s gift is to collaborate with you to identify systemic system blocks and help you release them gracefully and easily - so you can feel free and relaxed within yourself - express your true \\'who you are\\' - enabling you to celebrate life and express yourself in your own dynamic unique way - for a happy life.\", \\'\"I was amazed at how much we covered in such a short time\" \"Dynamic and Powerful\" \"Easy To Understand\" \"The Gift of Harmony book is better than the Secret - I read it from cover to cover in one night\" \"Practical &amp; Helpful\" \"Fantastic!\" \"The Reprogramming is the best, most effective, amazing transformation process I have ever discovered. It is transforming my life, and so quickly\" \"Working with Jelila is like doing 10 years of therapy in just a few hours - only it works!\"\\', \\'Please see more reviews on Tripadvisor - Jelila Spiritual Healer - http://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297701-d7113538-Reviews-Jelila_Spiritual_Healer_Ubud-Ubud_Bali.html\\', \\'e: jelila