       " Document(metadata={'parent_asin': '0135960991', 'average_rating': 4.5}, page_content='Modern Persuasion Strategies: The Hidden Advantage in Selling First Edition {\\'avatar\\': \\'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01Kv-W2ysOL._SY600_.png\\', \\'name\\': \\'Donald J. Moine\\', \\'about\\': [\\'Discover more of the author’s books, see similar authors, read author blogs and more\\']} Donald J. Moine (Author),  John H. Herd (Author) Books Business & Money Marketing & Sales  Featuring all the most current semantic and cybernetic research, this dynamic guide reveals powerful persuasion strategies that will help any salesperson \"read\" the emotional and mental makeup of a client--then customize a sales presentation the prospect will find irresistible.'),\n",
