       " Document(metadata={'parent_asin': '1502585030', 'average_rating': 4.6}, page_content='The Curious Magic of Buckeye Groves Paperback – November 7, 2014 {\\'avatar\\': \\'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gd8Hi+9vL._SY600_.jpg\\', \\'name\\': \\'Maura McCarley Torkildson\\', \\'about\\': [\\'Maura McCarley Torkildson is an author, artist, intuitive and Soul Creativity Support Mentor. She is the founder of Maura Torkildson Coaching and her work includes supporting creatives and spiritual women entrepreneurs to complete their creative soul projects. She is a Certified Professional Co-Active Coach and has an M.A. In Women’s Spirituality from New College of California. Her artwork has been exhibited in both the U.S. and Malta. For more information about her programs and private practice work, and to receive a free copy of her short E-book: Tools 4 Transformation, visit her website a www.mauratorkildsoncoaching.com\\']} Maura McCarley (Author) Books Science Fiction & Fantasy Fantasy About the Author Maura McCarley is an author of both non-fiction and fantasy. The \"Curious Magic of Buckeye Groves\" is her first fiction novel. Mythology, fairy tales, mysticism and the esoteric have always fascinated her. Maura has longed for magic all her life and so often found it by being swept away in a fantasy story. She believes that once upon a time humans had greater access to the non-physical realities, but have chosen to ignore them. The explosion of fantasy books, movies and games is a sign of our longing for what is missing in our world. Maura writes to create a world where magic is possible once again and where the human heart leads. Maura has an MA in Women\\'s Spirituality from New College of California. She was drawn to this pioneering program to explore the sacred feminine. Her work is inspired by her relationship with the divine feminine, nature, her experiences as a mystic and her work as a certified Co-Active Coach. Enter a magical world that can only be accessed through special portal trees. Follow Mirabel, a young woman, who is searching for her identity as she discovers her own special magic and lands in a quest to save two worlds - a crisis that only she can resolve. Mirabel Mairead McInness, her friend Janey and her partner Matt explore the depths of the human heart while searching for a magic lost through the mists of time and as they fight to save the trees that hold the key to that magic.'),\n",
